## Layout

```
app/            configuration (app.php, settings.php) and migrations
src/            application code — Controllers, Services, Models, Views
tests/          Unit/ and Integration/ suites
www/            web root
```

## Working with an AI assistant

`CLAUDE.md` carries the project's conventions — structure, testing rules, the API
contract and the front-end workflow — so an assistant does not have to guess them.
Keep it current when those change.
